WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:04.560
 『Hinako Jealous』

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:04.560
 『Hinako Jealous』

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.340
She's so late.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:18.080
How nice. If only mine were a little bigger.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.740
Sorry!

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:28.670
This is for one person?

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.570
Yes, Ninomiya-kun made it for me.

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:37.140
Again!

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:50.220
Did you get those massive tits just by eating?

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:50.690
Huh!

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:54.200
I tried doing the same thing when I was growing up too!!

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:55.640
But...

00:00:58.530 --> 00:00:59.950
There, there...

