00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:04.650
kyou mo ashita mo atashi zutto miteru kara

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:04.650
今日も明日もあたしずっと観てるから

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:04.650
Because I'll always be watching you, today and tomorrow too.

