00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:34.920
Episode 10

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:34.920
Let's Go Have Fun

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:34.920
Episode 10

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:34.920
Let's Go Have Fun

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:44.370
Thanks for the meal.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:58.300
What's wrong? Hang in there. Ninomiya Shungo?

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:01.320
Hang in there! Ninomiya Shungo?

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:04.850
I...

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.070
Ah, welcome back.

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:15.170
Welcome back.

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:17.550
Come, let's have dinner.

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.160
How pretty.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:23.260
Really?

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:25.160
Hey, take a look at this.

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:26.310
What is it?

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.690
<i>Heh, what?</i>

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:50.910
<i>Why?</i>

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.360
Hey, hang in there.

00:03:56.690 --> 00:03:59.510
Hey, wake up. Please wake up.

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:02.580
Wake up, Ninomiya Shungo.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.300
I...

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:21.220
I...

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:23.470
did that to Ninomiya-kun...

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:26.430
I'm fine.

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:29.660
You're not okay. Come on, let's go.

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:43.990
Ninomiya-kun.

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.860
My legs are still numb.

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:58.190
Yeah, they made us sit in that formal posture all night.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:01.280
And it's our day off too.

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:05.400
Our ultimate purpose was the success of the night party after all.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:12.790
<i>Why did Okushiro-san do that to me?</i>

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:19.460
<i>Also, that feeling of having my strength being sucked out of my body so quickly.</i>

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:26.600
Could that be the feeling when
a succubus drains your life force?

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:30.560
That would mean Okushiro-san is also...

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:39.530
That's right. The sensation of having your strength stolen from you...

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:41.520
I'm sure I've experienced it in the past.

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:46.700
Damnit, what's wrong with my memories?

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:51.040
He looks so depressed.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:54.960
I guess he failed to sneak into her room.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.130
Let's just leave him alone today.

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:00.420
Yeah.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.510
<i>After that kiss with Irori...</i>

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:10.600
<i>Ninomiya Shungo, today I'll definitely have you repay me for what you did ten years ago.</i>

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:12.230
Tasuku-han.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:15.100
Irori?

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:18.320
What is it?

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:24.030
Shungo-han looks awfully tired. Did something happen?

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.620
N-No idea.

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:28.240
Oh, really?

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:32.620
Perhaps it was my fault.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:36.000
What is it? If you don't have anything to say then please go away.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:39.130
Are you seriously saying that?

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:44.210
Fine then. Watch.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:51.520
Shungo-han.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.560
Okushiro-san?

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:58.400
Thank you for the meal yesterday.

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:00.560
Why did you do that?

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:04.360
It's my way of saying thanks for taking me to see the Togetsu Bridge yesterday.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:07.450
You didn't have to kiss me for something like that.

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:11.870
Will you accompany me during the leisure time today?

00:07:11.870 --> 00:07:13.910
Well, that's kinda...

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:18.250
But our relationship has already reached the kissing stage.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.390
Ninomiya-kun.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:43.230
That glasses wench!

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:46.280
She's gonna receive my divine punishment today.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.280
Hey there, Tsukimura-san.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:52.990
Regarding today's leisure time...

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.370
Do you have any place that you'd like to go to?

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:14.970
<i>I must have no regrets.</i>

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:18.940
I'm sorry.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.810
I've already made plans today.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:28.950
Please cut me some slack, Okushiro-san.

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:31.150
Ninomiya-kun!

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:32.900
Let's go.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:36.120
Tsukimura-san?

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.080
That girl...

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:42.000
Nice one, Tsukimura Mayu.

00:08:46.550 --> 00:08:47.750
Reika-san!

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:52.130
Let the three of us have lots of fun today, together with Ninomiya-kun!

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:56.720
Hey, hold on!

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.730
Come, let's go.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:04.020
Tsukimura Mayu, what are you trying...?

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:06.530
Tsukimura-san? Huh, wait.

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:14.360
Hey, would you cut it out and let go of my hand?

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:17.830
Tsukimura-san, what's the matter?

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:20.990
Does this have anything to do with what happened yesterday?

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:26.710
For a long time, I've wanted the three of us to do something like this.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:30.000
Well, you're causing a whole lot of trouble for me.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:35.300
With the three of us, I'm sure we'll be able to spend the day having lots of fun.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.180
Right, Ninomiya-kun?

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:39.300
Well, perhaps you're right.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.430
Right?

