00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:52.240
Reika-san, you should try some too.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:53.610
No, thank you.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.200
Would you please cut it out. It's unsightly.

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:02.960
I guess you're that kinda person.

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:28.570
A thousand is impossible.

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:30.610
Maybe six at best.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:32.860
How stupid.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.500
<i>Tsukimura-san.</i>

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:45.080
Let's go see the next one!

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:49.380
I know, I know already. So, please stop pulling my arm.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.300
Please try and calm down a little.

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:52.630
It's okay.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:56.470
You're coming too, Ninomiya-kun.

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:03.640
They haven't changed at all.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:07.060
However, I won't let those happy times continue.

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:13.150
It's in the past. You really don't know when to give up.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:23.540
Ojou-sama and Ninomiya-kun were getting along well, weren't they?

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.290
Ojou-sama...

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:29.670
Well then. I wonder where they're headed to next.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:46.720
It's so cold.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.230
So delicious.

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.570
Pickles first, now this.

00:11:51.570 --> 00:11:55.530
I feel like I'm going to get brain-freeze just by looking at her. {L: we call it brain-freeze in AU; is when you eat cold things too fast and ur head hurts}

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:59.280
This is heaven.

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:02.750
Oji-san, one more shaved ice with green tea and milk.

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.250
And red bean white gem for the topping.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:07.460
Sure, thank you very much.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.460
The shaved ice is delicious, isn't it, Shungo-kun?

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:15.130
<i>Shungo-kun?</i>

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:17.090
Oh, sheesh.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:19.600
You're spilling all over.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:30.610
It's delicious, Shungo-kun.

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:33.020
Oh, sheesh.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:41.910
<i>Could this be...</i>

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:43.620
Come on, keep still.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:46.120
Uh, sorry.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.120
\h   You can be a
\h dancing girl
too.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.120
{時代劇  扮装写真館}Era Drama Dressed up Photo Studio

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:57.420
Why a mid-wife?

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.630
You really look like a princess.

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:08.350
A princess and a dancing girl are totally different.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.270
A princess, huh?

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.100
Reika-san!

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:26.660
What are you doing?

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:30.540
Sorry.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:34.250
Ojou-sama being clumsy is cute too!

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:37.330
Hey, Shinobu. I don't think that's a good idea.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:42.050
I must get shots of Ojou-sama's precious moments.

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.340
Yeah, about that...

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:47.340
You look good in whatever you wear.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:50.010
Why are you saying such obvious things?

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:52.100
Aww, you're blushing.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.770
What's the matter, Tsukimura Mayu?

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:03.860
Sorry, I think I over-exerted myself.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.570
What's this?

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:09.570
That's my hair!

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.530
You sure have good luck, woman.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.790
We have orders to hurt you.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:20.330
We can wear costumes like that too?

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.920
Run!

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:26.170
Answer the young master's expectations!

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:30.430
Ojou-sama!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:32.640
What's wrong, Shinobu?

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:35.520
Run, Ninomiya Shungo!

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.230
What the hell!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.190
How did this happen?

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.030
I haven't a clue.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:51.950
They suddenly swung a sword at Tsukimura Mayu.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:54.240
At Tsukimura-san? Why?

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:57.910
Stop. Please stop.

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.160
Tsukimura Mayu!
-Tsukimura-san!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.500
Tsukimura-san, get on my back.

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:09.050
Only this once.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.680
Ojou-sama!

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:18.930
Shinobu?

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.190
Hurry! Hurry!

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.270
This way!

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:30.150
Hey, wasn't that Ninomiya's group?

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.120
Are they participating in some kinda event?

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:42.620
That sure looks like fun.

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:45.710
Pursue!

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.720
A dead end?

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.260
Who are you people?!

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:07.070
Kyoto is where I was born.

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:12.820
From the gods of the ancient times, grown from this land, the power of the Okushiro house was realised.

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:14.070
You...

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:15.620
Tasuku-san.

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:22.210
I planned to use my charm on Tsukimura Mayu to let you taste the meaning of shame before.

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:25.250
But now, I shall show you the meaning of suffering!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.630
W-Why are you doing this?

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:31.630
Obviously I'm taking revenge for the humiliation you put me through ten years ago.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.340
Ten years ago?

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:35.550
What did I do to you?

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.760
Are you saying you don't remember a thing?

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:44.270
Even if you don't remember, I won't ever forget.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.440
Assist me!

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:58.120
This Houjou Reika has the highest martial arts rank.

00:16:58.120 --> 00:16:59.990
Don't underestimate me.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.700
Don't come near me!

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:08.420
There's no end to them.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:10.920
They are coming again!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.680
You're as stubborn as ever.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.720
You haven't changed at all since that time.

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:24.600
Since that time?

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.810
That girl you were with kept on screaming...

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.360
"Please stop!"

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:31.940
That's...

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:32.990
It can't be!

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.990
That person got in the way.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:39.700
That person?

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:45.580
Please stop!

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:47.250
I'm begging you.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.640
Stop being so distant, Ninomiya.

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:04.810
Were you planning to keep this exciting event a secret from us?

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.770
Well, no...

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:10.360
This seems like a great stress reliever.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.820
Let me join in too?

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.780
Sorry, sorry!

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:19.240
War is definitely better than sightseeing.

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:22.490
Whatever Magnum!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:27.080
Whoa, that's good.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.500
Then, my turn. Honyarara Phantom!

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:41.140
Damn, you're persistent!

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:43.180
I'm not done yet!

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:45.020
Cut it out!

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:50.810
Tasuku-han.

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.990
What is it? Don't interfere.

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:07.830
If you don't have anything to say, then get lost.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:25.430
Weren't you in love with Ninomiya?

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:28.060
Sheesh, that's why men are so useless.

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:34.860
The only person I have ever loved is you.

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:36.780
I-Irori!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.570
Are you going to hold me?

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:43.840
Y-Yeah.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:49.620
What the hell was that about?

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:54.750
Did Ninomiya do all this as an excuse to get them together?

00:19:57.050 --> 00:20:00.470
Ninomiya-kun, this is self-restraint too.

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:04.180
That sure was fun.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:05.890
Right, Reika-san?

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:07.810
You, sheesh.

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:12.640
Too bad for you.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:13.480
Why?

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.270
Weren't you interested in Okushiro-san?

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:16.730
I didn't think about her like that.

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:17.730
You remembered.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:18.720
You got it all wrong.

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:20.280
No, it's a lie, right?

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:29.160
Honestly, what a hectic day.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:33.000
But anyway, it's good that it resolved itself in the end.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.670
But, what about the arrangements?

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:40.340
Ah, just forget about it. The trip itself was memorable.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:44.840
<i>Say, are you really satisfied with that?</i>

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:51.730
Ojou-sama?

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.570
Ojou-sama?!

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:03.990
Forgive me, Shinobu.

